sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as React UI
  participant API as FastAPI
  participant DISC as DiscoveryRunner
  participant JOB as ConversionJob
  participant WF as LangGraph batch workflow
  participant KB as Local KB
  participant DV as Devin API
  participant PKG as Package and report builders

  User->>UI: Select source and target
  UI->>API: POST /api/session/confirm
  API->>API: Create local session and start local draft or PlanJob
  opt Devin planning is configured
    API->>DV: Send planning prompt and optional inventory summary
    DV-->>API: Planning result
  end
  API-->>UI: Session ID and plan status
  User->>UI: Upload source files
  UI->>API: POST /api/uploads
  API->>DISC: Store encrypted files and queue local discovery
  DISC-->>API: Inventory and dependency graph
  API-->>UI: Upload and discovery status
  UI->>API: POST /api/convert/estimate
  API-->>UI: Object count, batches, session estimate
  UI-->>User: Show consent dialog before code is sent
  User->>UI: Explicitly consent to send code to Devin
  UI->>API: POST /api/convert {consent: true, object_ids?: [...]}
  API->>API: Require consent and create ConversionJob
  API->>JOB: Start conversion
  UI->>API: GET /api/convert/jobs/{job_id}/events
  Note over UI,JOB: Cancellation is available during any active batch
  loop Each dependency-aware batch of objects
    JOB->>WF: Run the whole batch
    WF->>KB: Retrieve relevant context for batch objects
    par Voter A for this batch
      WF->>DV: Create session with batch context
    and Voter B for this batch
      WF->>DV: Create session with batch context
    and Voter C for this batch
      WF->>DV: Create session with batch context
    end
    DV-->>WF: Structured candidates from three sessions
    WF->>WF: Consensus, validate, score each object
    alt One or more objects need escalation
      WF->>DV: One escalation session for those objects in the batch
      DV-->>WF: Revised candidates
      WF->>WF: Re-validate and re-score
    else No escalation needed
      WF->>WF: Keep the selected consensus candidates
    end
    WF-->>JOB: Final per-object results for this batch
    API-->>UI: SSE convert.batch progress event
    opt User cancels while a batch is active
      UI->>API: POST /api/convert/jobs/{job_id}/cancel
      API->>JOB: Cancel sessions and finalize unresolved objects
    end
  end
  UI->>API: GET /api/convert/jobs/{job_id}
  API-->>UI: Final job snapshot and counts
  opt Re-convert selected objects after the base run finishes
    User->>UI: Select objects and confirm conversion consent
    UI->>API: POST /api/convert {consent: true, object_ids: [...]}
    API->>JOB: Create selected job with base run in memory
    JOB->>JOB: Merge selected results into the base run
  end
  User->>UI: Download package or report
  UI->>API: GET /api/download?name=...
  API->>PKG: Build ZIP from completed or cancelled run
  PKG-->>UI: Converted ZIP
  UI->>API: GET /api/report.md or /api/report.pdf
  API->>PKG: Build session report
  PKG-->>UI: Markdown or PDF report
